--- [GIAI CHI TIET] KIEM TRA DA THUC TOI GIAN ---
Da thuc can kiem tra: f(x) = x + 1
Ap dung thuat toan Ben-Or test tren GF(2)...
Ket luan: f(x) KHONG PHAI LA da thuc bat kha quy.

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] KIEM TRA DA THUC TOI GIAN ---
Da thuc can kiem tra: f(x) = x^3 + x + 1
Ap dung thuat toan Ben-Or test tren GF(2)...
Ket luan: f(x) LA da thuc bat kha quy.

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] SINH DA THUC TOI GIAN BAC 2 ---
Cac da thuc thoa man (dang nhi phan va toan hoc):
 + 111 (x^2 + x + 1)

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] SINH DA THUC TOI GIAN BAC 5 ---
Cac da thuc thoa man (dang nhi phan va toan hoc):
 + 100101 (x^5 + x^2 + 1)
 + 101001 (x^5 + x^3 + 1)
 + 101111 (x^5 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1)
 + 110111 (x^5 + x^4 + x^2 + x + 1)
 + 111011 (x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1)
 + 111101 (x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + 1)

